OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister says Welsh spending
OL,4,Apowers takes step forward after Andy
OL,5,ABurnham meeting
OL,6,
OL,7,FWelsh First Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth
OL,8,Fsays there has been a "significant step
OL,9,Fforward" with regards to his country's
OL,10,Fspending and borrowing powers after
OL,11,Fmeeting the prime minister.
OL,13,FAndy Burnham held a meeting of his
OL,14,FNational Economic Council with the
OL,15,Ffirst ministers of Wales and Scotland
OL,16,Fon Friday, after which ap Iorwerth said
OL,17,Fit was a matter of "how and when" a
OL,18,Floosening of financial restrictions
OL,19,Fwill take place.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
