OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister says Welsh spending
OL,4,Apowers takes step forward after Andy
OL,5,ABurnham meeting
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt the summit in Glasgow, Burnham
OL,8,Flobbied the government leaders to
OL,9,Fdevolve "deeper" to the regions of
OL,10,FWales and Scotland.
OL,12,FThe prime minister said the two first
OL,13,Fministers had agreed to work with him
OL,14,Fon "regional empowerment".
